35
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,164
Where are the buttons? 
What should I do?

36
00:02:54,164 --> 00:02:57,000
How can I accomplish my goal?

37
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:01,000
So that is, at its core, a learning
experience.

38
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:08,000
So today I'm going to view user experience
as a form of learning experience.

39
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:13,000
And if we do that, we can get some help,
we can get some hints from educators.

40
00:03:13,709 --> 00:03:19,165
Because they have spent a lot of time
trying to figure out

41
00:03:19,165 --> 00:03:22,520
how to effectively support learners.

42
00:03:24,365 --> 00:03:28,000
Let's look at some questions they have
